{"seq":1,"slug":"precision-recall","title":"精确率与召回率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/information-retrieval/evaluation-metrics/precision-recall","wordCount":1437,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"精确率与召回率\">精确率与召回率</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>精确率（Precision）和召回率（Recall）是信息检索评估中最基础的两个指标，它们从不同维度衡量检索系统的效果。精确率衡量系统返回的结果中有多少是真正相关的（「返回的有多准」），召回率衡量所有相关文档中有多少被系统成功检索到（「该找的找回了多少」）。两者之间存在天然的张力——提高精确率往往会降低召回率，反之亦然。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[文档集合 D] --&gt; B[检索系统]&#10;    B --&gt; C[返回结果集 R]&#10;    A --&gt; D[相关文档集 Rel]&#10;    C --&gt; E[R ∩ Rel: 正确返回的相关文档]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;精确率 = |R ∩ Rel| / |R|&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; G[&quot;召回率 = |R ∩ Rel| / |Rel|&quot;]&#10;    subgraph 混淆矩阵视角&#10;        H[TP: 返回且相关]&#10;        I[FP: 返回但不相关]&#10;        J[FN: 未返回但相关]&#10;        K[TN: 未返回且不相关]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[文档集合 D] --&gt; B[检索系统]\n    B --&gt; C[返回结果集 R]\n    A --&gt; D[相关文档集 Rel]\n    C --&gt; E[R ∩ Rel: 正确返回的相关文档]\n    E --&gt; F[\"精确率 = |R ∩ Rel| / |R|\"]\n    E --&gt; G[\"召回率 = |R ∩ Rel| / |Rel|\"]\n    subgraph 混淆矩阵视角\n        H[TP: 返回且相关]\n        I[FP: 返回但不相关]\n        J[FN: 未返回但相关]\n        K[TN: 未返回且不相关]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>直觉理解</th>\n<th>取值范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确率 Precision</td>\n<td>TP / (TP + FP)</td>\n<td>返回结果的纯度</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>召回率 Recall</td>\n<td>TP / (TP + FN)</td>\n<td>相关文档的覆盖度</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>F1 Score</td>\n<td>2PR / (P + R)</td>\n<td>P 和 R 的调和平均</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fβ Score</td>\n<td>(1+β²)PR / (β²P + R)</td>\n<td>P 和 R 的加权调和平均</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Accuracy</td>\n<td>(TP + TN) / (TP+FP+FN+TN)</td>\n<td>整体正确率（IR 中少用）</td>\n<td>[0, 1]</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"集合检索中的-p-r-计算\">集合检索中的 P/R 计算</h2><p>在布尔检索模型中，系统返回一个无序的文档集合，精确率和召回率的计算直截了当。设相关文档集合为 Rel，返回结果集为 R，则 <code>P = |R ∩ Rel| / |R|</code>，<code>R = |R ∩ Rel| / |Rel|</code>。</p>\n<p>实际计算需要「相关性判定」（Relevance Judgment）作为基准。在标准评测中，评估者会对查询-文档对标注二元相关性（相关/不相关）或分级相关性（0-4 分）。TREC（Text REtrieval Conference）使用「pooling」方法：将多个系统的 top-k 结果合并，人工标注该池中的文档相关性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface RelevanceJudgment {&#10;  readonly queryId: string;&#10;  readonly docId: string;&#10;  readonly relevance: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface RetrievalResult {&#10;  readonly queryId: string;&#10;  readonly rankedDocs: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface PrecisionRecallResult {&#10;  readonly precision: number;&#10;  readonly recall: number;&#10;  readonly f1: number;&#10;  readonly fBeta: number;&#10;  readonly tp: number;&#10;  readonly fp: number;&#10;  readonly fn: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function computePrecisionRecall(&#10;  retrieved: ReadonlyArray&lt;string&gt;,&#10;  relevant: ReadonlySet&lt;string&gt;,&#10;  beta: number = 1,&#10;): PrecisionRecallResult {&#10;  let tp = 0;&#10;  let fp = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (const docId of retrieved) {&#10;    if (relevant.has(docId)) {&#10;      tp++;&#10;    } else {&#10;      fp++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const fn = relevant.size - tp;&#10;  const precision = retrieved.length &gt; 0 ? tp / retrieved.length : 0;&#10;  const recall = relevant.size &gt; 0 ? tp / relevant.size : 0;&#10;  const f1Denom = precision + recall;&#10;  const f1 = f1Denom &gt; 0 ? (2 * precision * recall) / f1Denom : 0;&#10;  const betaSq = beta * beta;&#10;  const fBetaDenom = betaSq * precision + recall;&#10;  const fBeta = fBetaDenom &gt; 0 ? ((1 + betaSq) * precision * recall) / fBetaDenom : 0;&#10;&#10;  return { precision, recall, f1, fBeta, tp, fp, fn };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RelevanceJudgment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> queryId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> docId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> relevance</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RetrievalResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> queryId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> rankedDocs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ReadonlyArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PrecisionRecallResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> precision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> recall</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> f1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  readonly</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> fBeta</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><